# Journey: asked for recommendations, scout answers and stops there. It doesn't
# end by offering to do more, like posting an itinerary nobody asked for.
# Needs the AI.
members maya leo priya
from destination-chosen

maya: @scout what would you recommend doing in san juan? we want beaches and a big night out
expect scout ~ "beach"
expect scout !~ "itinerary"
expect scout !~ "want me to"
expect scout !~ "if you want, i"
expect scout !~ "i can"
expect state itinerary = []
